# Vendored examples/tests inside the coprocessor's copy of espressif__esp_hosted:
# not referenced by coprocessor/main (only depends on the top-level esp_hosted
# component itself), and the extra "coprocessor/" path prefix pushes several of
# their deeply-nested files past Windows' 260-char MAX_PATH, which makes `git
# add coprocessor/` fail silently for the whole tree. Safe to exclude.
coprocessor/managed_components/espressif__esp_hosted/examples/
coprocessor/managed_components/espressif__esp_hosted/port/idf_components/esp_wifi_remote/esp_wifi_remote/components/esp_wifi_remote/test/